You are incorrect about there not being an SRI.COM machine.  I periodically
have an account on it, although I do not at present.

Without going into the ins-and-outs of how we are organized, as in
many large organizations, some information systems policies are
centralized and applied to the entire organization and others are
handled by the administrators of various subnets and specific systems.
